<title>EGYPT: EGYPT'S MISR EXTERIOR BANK THREE MONTHS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>EGYPT'S MISR EXTERIOR BANK THREE MONTHS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Misr Exterior Bank results for the first quarter of the 1997 calendar year, the bank's financial year.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds with comparative figures from previous year):</p>
<p>				     31MARCH97	    31MARCH96</p>
<p>    Total deposits	  3,109,000,000	3,057,000,000</p>
<p>    Total assets	    3,923,000,000	3,733,000,000</p>
<p>    Shareholders funds	250,000,000	  222,000,000</p>
<p>    Distributable profits    28,000,000	   19,000,000</p>
<p>Full name is Misr Exterior Bank.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.395 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
